{"ref":"BDB, מִגְדֹּל","hw":"מִגְדֹּל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִגְדֹּל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.</strong> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִגְדּוֹל</span> only <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.14\">Je 46:14</a>) fortified city on the NE. border of Egypt <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:2\" href=\"/Exodus.14.2\">Ex 14:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:7\" href=\"/Numbers.33.7\">Nu 33:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 44:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.44.1\">Je 44:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.14\">46:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.10\">Ez 29:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.6\">30:6</a>; Copt. <em>meschtôl</em> (Champoll.<sup>L’Égypte sous les Pharaons ii. 79</sup>), Egyptian <em>makƟel</em> Eb<sup>GS 522</sup>.","next":"BDB, גָּדַע","prev":"BDB, מִגְדּוֹל"}